{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13513","headline":"移耶溪旧居呈陈元初校书 · 陈孙","name":"移耶溪旧居呈陈元初校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸡犬渔舟里，长谣任兴行。\n即令邀客醉，已被远山迎。\n书笈将非重，荷衣着甚轻。\n谢安无个事，忽起爲苍生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈孙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}